# Fixed Database Architecture (REV19 - ENHANCED)

The architecture is LOCKED.

Do not redesign modules.

Each module owns its Single Source Of Truth (SSOT).

------------------------------------------------

# 000 Platform (HARD INFRA LAYER)

Owns ONLY:

- database infrastructure
- auth integration (Supabase)
- RLS helpers
- audit logging
- monitoring
- queues
- events
- webhooks
- scheduler / cron
- vault / secrets
- storage
- platform utilities
- shared SQL helpers (generic only)

❗ NEVER contains business entities or domain logic

RULE:
000_supabase_platform.sql MUST be:
- dependency-free
- reset-safe
- executable in isolation
- safe for `supabase db reset`

------------------------------------------------

# 001–013 BUSINESS DOMAINS (SSOT ENFORCED)

Each module is the ONLY owner of its domain.

No cross-module ownership.

------------------------------------------------

